{"sha": "4c3b90fa2555cd91dbc19c9c2a3d1eed713c138652cfe2cfa5a6ae191613c56e", "body": ["\\chapter{代数：方程与不等式}\\label{ch:g10:algebra}", "", "代数是用字母进行计算的艺术。本章复习并深化", "两种基本运算 --- 展开与因式分解 --- 并借助它们", "系统地求解方程与不等式，以符号表", "为核心工具。", "", "\\section{展开与因式分解}", "", "\\begin{definition}[展开、因式分解]\\label{def:g10:algebra:expand}", "\\emph{展开}\\index{展开}一个式子，是指把乘积化为和，", "\\emph{因式分解}\\index{因式分解}则是其逆过程，", "即把和化为乘积。基本法则是分配律：", "\\[", "k(a + b) = ka + kb,", "\\qquad", "(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:algebra:expand}", "逐步展开 $(2x + 3)(x - 5)$：", "\\begin{align*}", "(2x + 3)(x - 5)", "&= 2x \\times x + 2x \\times (-5) + 3 \\times x + 3 \\times (-5) \\\\", "&= 2x^2 - 10x + 3x - 15 \\\\", "&= 2x^2 - 7x - 15 .", "\\end{align*}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[乘法公式]\\label{thm:g10:algebra:identities}", "对任意实数 $a$ 与 $b$，有：", "\\[", "(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2,", "\\qquad", "(a-b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2,", "\\qquad", "(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - b^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "每一式都可直接展开。对第一式：", "\\[", "(a+b)^2 = (a+b)(a+b) = a^2 + ab + ba + b^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2 .", "\\]", "第二式将 $b$ 换成 $-b$ 即得：$(a-b)^2 = a^2 + 2a(-b) +", "(-b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2$。对第三式：", "$(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - ab + ba - b^2 = a^2 - b^2$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (5,5);", "  \\draw[thick] (3.4,0) -- (3.4,5);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,3.4) -- (5,3.4);", "  \\fill[omDef!12] (0,0) rectangle (3.4,3.4);", "  \\fill[omThm!12] (3.4,3.4) rectangle (5,5);", "  \\fill[omProp!12] (3.4,0) rectangle (5,3.4);", "  \\fill[omProp!12] (0,3.4) rectangle (3.4,5);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.7,1.7) {$a^2$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.2,4.2) {$b^2$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (4.2,1.7) {$ab$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.7,4.2) {$ab$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.7,0) {$a$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (4.2,0) {$b$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,1.7) {$a$};", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,4.2) {$b$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 为何 $(a+b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2$：边长为 $a + b$ 的正方形", "分成边长为 $a$ 的正方形、边长为 $b$ 的正方形，以及两个 $a \\times b$", "矩形。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:algebra:identities}", "正用（展开）与逆用（因式分解）：", "\\begin{align*}", "(3x + 2)^2 &= 9x^2 + 12x + 4,", "& x^2 - 25 &= (x+5)(x-5), \\\\", "(x - 4)^2 &= x^2 - 8x + 16,", "& 4x^2 + 4x + 1 &= (2x + 1)^2 .", "\\end{align*}", "这一方法也便于心算：$101 \\times 99 = (100+1)(100-1) =", "10000 - 1 = 9999$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[式子的因式分解]\\label{met:g10:algebra:factor}", "按以下顺序尝试：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{提公因式：}找出每一项都含有的因式，并把它", "        提到括号外，例如 $6x^2 + 4x = 2x(3x + 2)$。公因式也可以是", "        整个括号，如 $(x+1)(2x-3) + (x+1)(x+7) = (x+1)(3x+4)$。", "  \\item \\emph{乘法公式：}识别 $a^2 - b^2$，或", "        $a^2 \\pm 2ab + b^2$ 形式，例如 $9x^2 - 16 = (3x)^2 - 4^2 =", "        (3x+4)(3x-4)$。", "  \\item 综合运用两种方法，并将结果展开以检验。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:algebra:factorsteps}", "因式分解 $E = (2x + 1)^2 - (x - 3)^2$。这是两个平方之差", "$a^2 - b^2$ 的形式，其中 $a = 2x+1$，$b = x-3$：", "\\begin{align*}", "E &= \\bigl[(2x+1) + (x-3)\\bigr] \\times \\bigl[(2x+1) - (x-3)\\bigr] \\\\", "  &= (3x - 2)(2x + 1 - x + 3) \\\\", "  &= (3x - 2)(x + 4).", "\\end{align*}", "注意第二个括号：减去 $x - 3$ 即减去 $x$", "\\emph{并}加上 $3$。", "\\end{example}", ""]}